  "solution": {
    "text": "Since  <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi> </mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn><mi> </mi><mo>∀</mo><mi> </mi><mi>x</mi><mi> </mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>  for  <math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <br >LHD at  <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math>  is zero<br >And RHD at  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi> </mi><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi> </mi><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi> </mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></math> <br >Hence  <math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>  is not differentiable at  <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math> <br >Similarly LHD at  <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math>  is greater than 1<br > <math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>  is not differentiable at  <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math>"
